GetPendingReward_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given account never staked
│  └── it should return zero
├── given account is the only staker
│  └── it should return zero
├── given account fully unstaked
│  └── it should return zero
└── given account holds a stake alongside others
   ├── given no payout since the last interaction
   │  └── it should return zero
   └── given payouts since the last interaction
      └── it should return the pro rata share of the dividends
